{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Schrodinger's Cat Burglar",
    "steam_appid": 2111550,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/ce38a36ff2625ed8cfe6d233337dc97a.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BRAND NEW DEMO!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo has been refreshed with a whole new experience -<strong> SPLIT LABS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have quantum powers from the start, so it's perfect for single player or co-operative play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This level has a few new tricks up it's sleeve - so if you've played the previous demo, prepare yourself for even more quantum tomfoolery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/12d879e1ae9ac6e9b46a9a3f6e433006.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUTE CATS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amidst a heist gone wrong, <strong>Mittens </strong>\u2014 the world's greatest (and most literal) cat burglar \u2014 finds herself caught in a quantum experiment, and gains <strong>incredible powers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/deecdf29a9aaeb468c04ec3cf15a95a5.poster.avif?t=1752040736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/deecdf29a9aaeb468c04ec3cf15a95a5.webm?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/deecdf29a9aaeb468c04ec3cf15a95a5.mp4?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With the help of her friends and some new quantum tricks up her sleeve, Mittens must puzzle her way through the secretive research facility, <strong>uncover the truth</strong>, and make it home before breakfast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/73ca37ddf23e0b4b612cd56c3f1fae1d.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FUN PUZZLES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is based around a central <strong>quantum mechanic</strong> \u2014 at the press of a button Mittens can split into two cats, who can each be controlled to solve puzzles and cause trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/f458a9f09d487b5e27c09ec90adf115d.poster.avif?t=1752040736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/f458a9f09d487b5e27c09ec90adf115d.webm?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/f458a9f09d487b5e27c09ec90adf115d.mp4?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As long as no one is looking, Mittens can exist in two places at once \u2014 if she's observed, however, things start to get <i>theoretical</i>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/13e9e064f815ec0624c8d54dc9d81ff2.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">QUANTUM MADNESS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being theoretical lets you pass through doors (that could theoretically have opened), and avoid detection by security (you can't detect what doesn't exist).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/c185ad688497872e99c218a9eece6d81.poster.avif?t=1752040736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/c185ad688497872e99c218a9eece6d81.webm?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/c185ad688497872e99c218a9eece6d81.mp4?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It does have drawbacks however - you can't use items or interact with the world until your quantum twin is no longer observed - then you can go back to both being plausible quantum possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your powers to access the inaccessible, evade the inevitable, and heist the unheistable to become <strong>Schrodinger's Cat Burglar!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/8cd3fb1e84d073aed46561736e5ec6f2.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A QUANTUM ADVENTURE THAT'S <i>ONE</i> OF A KIND!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support from :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/f38c6a129ab5b37d290c8efc5267d046.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/ce38a36ff2625ed8cfe6d233337dc97a.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BRAND NEW DEMO!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo has been refreshed with a whole new experience -<strong> SPLIT LABS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have quantum powers from the start, so it's perfect for single player or co-operative play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This level has a few new tricks up it's sleeve - so if you've played the previous demo, prepare yourself for even more quantum tomfoolery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/12d879e1ae9ac6e9b46a9a3f6e433006.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUTE CATS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amidst a heist gone wrong, <strong>Mittens </strong>\u2014 the world's greatest (and most literal) cat burglar \u2014 finds herself caught in a quantum experiment, and gains <strong>incredible powers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/deecdf29a9aaeb468c04ec3cf15a95a5.poster.avif?t=1752040736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/deecdf29a9aaeb468c04ec3cf15a95a5.webm?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/deecdf29a9aaeb468c04ec3cf15a95a5.mp4?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With the help of her friends and some new quantum tricks up her sleeve, Mittens must puzzle her way through the secretive research facility, <strong>uncover the truth</strong>, and make it home before breakfast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/73ca37ddf23e0b4b612cd56c3f1fae1d.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FUN PUZZLES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is based around a central <strong>quantum mechanic</strong> \u2014 at the press of a button Mittens can split into two cats, who can each be controlled to solve puzzles and cause trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/f458a9f09d487b5e27c09ec90adf115d.poster.avif?t=1752040736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/f458a9f09d487b5e27c09ec90adf115d.webm?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/f458a9f09d487b5e27c09ec90adf115d.mp4?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As long as no one is looking, Mittens can exist in two places at once \u2014 if she's observed, however, things start to get <i>theoretical</i>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/13e9e064f815ec0624c8d54dc9d81ff2.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">QUANTUM MADNESS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being theoretical lets you pass through doors (that could theoretically have opened), and avoid detection by security (you can't detect what doesn't exist).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/c185ad688497872e99c218a9eece6d81.poster.avif?t=1752040736\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/c185ad688497872e99c218a9eece6d81.webm?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/c185ad688497872e99c218a9eece6d81.mp4?t=1752040736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It does have drawbacks however - you can't use items or interact with the world until your quantum twin is no longer observed - then you can go back to both being plausible quantum possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your powers to access the inaccessible, evade the inevitable, and heist the unheistable to become <strong>Schrodinger's Cat Burglar!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/8cd3fb1e84d073aed46561736e5ec6f2.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A QUANTUM ADVENTURE THAT'S <i>ONE</i> OF A KIND!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support from :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111550/extras/f38c6a129ab5b37d290c8efc5267d046.avif?t=1752040736\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Portal with cats - a puzzle heist adventure with a quantum flavour! Mittens the cat stumbles into a quantum experiment and gains incredible new powers - the ability to be in two places at once. Explore, solve logic puzzles and evade capture by pest control robots to ultimately save the day!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cSchrodinger\u2019s Cat Burglar was one of the booths that was so popular that I was forced to circle back multiple times before I was able to have a proper chat with Martin, the lead developer on this cute quantum physics-infused puzzle game.\u201d<br>Player2<br><br>\u201cWorrying what your pet might be up to while you\u2019re away has never been so hilarious.\u201d<br>GamesHub<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s all sorts of cheeky with puzzles that really require you to stop and think, and the mechanics of \u2018observed\u2019 and \u2018theoretical\u2019 are cool as hell.\u201d<br>Kotaku<br>",
